### ============================================
### Day 9 - Authentication Test Evidence
### Support Desk Ticket API
### ============================================

### 1. Health endpoint is public (no token) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. Ticket endpoint without token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

### 3. Register a normal USER -> returns token (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amir",
  "email": "amir@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Login as USER -> returns token (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "amir@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Ticket endpoint WITH USER token -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbWlyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpc3MiOiJhc3NldC10cmFja2VyIiwibmFtZSI6IkFtaXIiLCJleHAiOjE3ODUzOTM1MTMsImlhdCI6MTc4NTM4OTkxMywidXNlcklkIjoiNmE2YWNmZjFkNTY2ZjJjZjJjMmRkOGMwIn0._i6xwaNRCWgML-2FlCUG__zWQj6hAj4G4-TfyN1cj5E

